{% comment %}
  Maison Cavallé — dropdown chevron

  A downward chevron for dropdown triggers, drawn as an SVG in place of the
  "⌄" text glyph so it renders the same in every font and on every device.
  It inherits the text colour; the caller sizes and rotates it.

  Accepts:
    class - extra class for the context that sizes the chevron
{% endcomment %}
<svg
  class="jci-chevron{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
  aria-hidden="true"
  focusable="false"
>
  <path
    d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.5"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
  ></path>
</svg>
